<title>REPUBLIC OF IRELAND: Norish H1 pretax profit moves into black.</title>
<headline>Norish H1 pretax profit moves into black.</headline>
<dateline>DUBLIN 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30</p>
<p>					  (million punts unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		6.18		   vs 6.34 loss</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 nil		    vs nil</p>
<p> Pretax		     0.69 profit	  vs 0.57 loss</p>
<p> Turnover		   4.95		   vs 4.37</p>
<p> Operating result	 0.65 gain	    vs 0.41 loss</p>
<p> Exceptional		0.29 gain	    vs 0.10 gain</p>
<p> Net interest payable   0.25		   vs 0.27</p>
<p> Tax charge		 0.17		   vs nil</p>
<p> Net taxed		  0.52 profit	  vs 0.57 loss</p>
<p> Attributable	     0.52 profit	  vs 0.54 loss</p>
<p>NOTE - Irish cold storage firm Norish Plc said its interim results to end-June 1996 represented a welcome return to profitablity after a period of heavy rationalisation and disposal.</p>
<p>-- Dublin Newsroom +353 1 676 9775</p>
</text>
